+for consumption by that event's ENG-06 position — and the stage-10 boundary inference
+(``_concession_event``: latest MODIFICATION, else TP_CHANGE) is only the fallback for a quota
+without conserving dated history. A credit memo consumes only quotas whose origin precedes it
+(S10-R-14 "oldest first", read as dated origin in ENG-06 order). CPU only.
+"""
